  "instructions": [
    "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil and cook the pasta according to the package instructions.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the grated bottarga, active dry yeast, and jamaican jerk seasoning.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat and add the diced scotch bonnet peppers, cooking until fragrant.",
    "Add the cooked pasta to the skillet, tossing to combine with the peppers and oil.",
    "Add the pasta water to the skillet, stirring to create a creamy emulsion.",
    "Stir in the bottarga and yeast mixture, cooking for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with nutritional yeast if desired."
  ],
